swimlane Insurance Claim
direction-lr

lane Customer gray
lane Claims Agent blue
lane Adjuster purple
lane Payments green

tag Risk as r
  low green
  high red

[Submit]
  Customer
    Submit Claim
[Triage]
  Customer
    (!Rejected)
  Claims Agent
    <Validate>
    <+ Fork>
[Assess]
  Customer
    (!Denied)
  Claims Agent
    Fraud Check r: high
  Adjuster
    Assign Adjuster
    [[Inspect Property]]
    <Approve>
[Settle]
  Payments
    Issue Payment
    (Paid) success

Submit Claim -> <Validate>
<Validate>
  -invalid-> (!Rejected)
  -valid-> <+ Fork>
<+ Fork>
  -> Fraud Check -> <Approve>
  -> Assign Adjuster -> [[Inspect Property]]
[[Inspect Property]]
  -retry-> Assign Adjuster
  -> <Approve>
<Approve>
  -reject-> (!Denied)
  -approve-> Issue Payment -> (Paid)
